note social/50route.om: soroute (the social pages and POST actions) and the fragments the server
note and ForgeBrowse call (sobar, sofolbar, sostarsof, counts). HTML only through fput/fesc/fnum/
note fputb/flink; every link and form action starts at the base (X-Forge-Base).
note ---- small output helpers
fn soerr code ulong m view uchar * to long
put fkind 0 0
fsetti tsterr
fput tshe1
fesc m
fput tshe2
ret long code
end
fn sopis t view uchar * to bool
if ne get fpathl 0 len t
ret false
end
for i ulong len t bound 64
if ne get fpath i get t i
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
fn sorestis t view uchar * to bool
if ne get frestl 0 len t
ret false
end
for i ulong len t bound 64
if ne get frest i get t i
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
note sooutid: escaped bytes of string id s from offset a
fn sooutid s ulong a ulong to void
o = get gsso s
l = get gssl s
if ge a l
ret
end
for i ulong sub l a bound 4096
fescc get gsstr add add o a i
end
end
note souser: a user link (display name) or the shortened DID
fn souser d ulong to void
fput tsrepo1
fputb
sonmout d
fput tsha2
if ne get gsnm d 0
sonmout d
fput tsha3
ret
end
fput tscode1
o = get gsso d
for i ulong 16
fescc get gsstr add add o len tsdidp i
end
fput tsell
fput tscode2
fput tsha3
end
